Journey: The ClaimDesk queue and review pages meet WCAG 2.2 AA
Id: a11y-claimdesk
Tags: @a11y @nonfunctional @backoffice
Role: adjuster
Risk: 3
Requirements: A11Y-2

Log in
Open ${BACKOFFICE_URL}/queue
  Expect the page contains "Claims queue"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
Open ${BACKOFFICE_URL}/claims/CLM-100005
  Expect the page contains "Review claim CLM-100005"
Check the page for accessibility issues at WCAG 2.2 level AA
